  "description": "This walk in Mullingar takes you along the canal to Lough Owel. Starting near the train station you can follow the Royal Canal north east to link up with the Lough Owel Feeder. This will take you north to the edge of the lough where you can enjoy some fine views across the water. You can continue your walking on the Athlone - Mullingar Greenway.",
